1. Definitions

   "Licensor" means Josh Lee.

   "Starter Content" means the original code, templates, documentation,
   examples and other Superwork-authored materials in this repository as
   provided by the Licensor — including its documentation, assignment and
   worksheet templates, example World, seed and scenario files, and agent
   instructions — but not Third-Party Components or Participant Work.

   "Third-Party Components" means software and other material that this
   repository uses or references but that is licensed under its own terms,
   including the npm packages @superwork/world-spec, @superwork/cli and yaml,
   and any other dependency installed into node_modules.

   "Participant Work" means original material you create yourself while doing
   the homework, such as your own World definition, your answers in the
   assignment files, your scenarios and your evidence.

   "Permitted Purpose" means (a) participating in the Agentic World Bootcamp,
   and (b) completing, submitting and personally studying your own educational
   homework for it.

